<Positioned left="48" top="1076" width="1704"><Container alignment="CENTER_LEFT"><Text fontSize="11" color="#6C7C99FF" fontFamily="Noto Sans Mono CJK SC" fontStyle="NORMAL">The series is the published annual minimum of daily Southern Hemisphere column ozone. The white line is a five-year trailing mean computed here. The 220 DU rule is the published definition of the hole.</Text></Container></Positioned>
